  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile with avgpool aggregation (config_002) outperforms singleprofile (config_001) and transformer aggregation (config_003). This experiment tests whether switching the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 (a more complex encoder) in the multiprofile/avgpool setup clarifies if encoder choice impacts performance. It isolates the RNA encoder's effect while maintaining the promising multiprofile and avgpool configuration, balancing exploration of key design choices with prior exploitation of multiprofile benefits."
